01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:45.000
But if you voted for him.

01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:49.000
Now, let me tell you something.

01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:51.000
On this basis,

01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:53.000
the Sephardic community

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:55.000
in Amsterdam,

01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:57.000
and that's both in Shoharu,

01:00:57.000 --> 01:00:59.000
yes,

01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:01.000
they believe that for hazzan, even one person could object.

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:03.000
The majority is no good.

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:05.000
I have to be

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:07.000
unanimity. Why?

01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:09.000
He represents me. I don't want him to represent me.

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:11.000
Do they ever agree?

01:01:11.000 --> 01:01:13.000
Oh yes.

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:15.000
Oh yes.

01:01:15.000 --> 01:01:17.000
I have to be unanimity.

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:21.000
Now, some people disagree with this.

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:23.000
They say, no, for hazzan you need only majority.

01:01:23.000 --> 01:01:25.000
Disagreement among young people.

01:01:25.000 --> 01:01:27.000
But, Shoharu,

01:01:27.000 --> 01:01:29.000
he wrote the opinion, registered the opinion,

01:01:29.000 --> 01:01:31.000
and says, you're unanimity.

01:01:31.000 --> 01:01:33.000
Why? He's representing me.

01:01:35.000 --> 01:01:37.000
I don't want him to represent me.

01:01:39.000 --> 01:01:41.000
Fine. So,

01:01:41.000 --> 01:01:43.000
most people are

01:01:43.000 --> 01:01:45.000
reasonable, and then of course they listen.

01:01:45.000 --> 01:01:47.000
It's no better than that. Do you know anybody better than that?

01:01:47.000 --> 01:01:49.000
So, they had to negotiate.

01:01:49.000 --> 01:01:51.000
But,

01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:53.000
the point is, that from the

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:55.000
legally, because it is

01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:57.000
suburb,

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:59.000
is a corporation.

01:02:01.000 --> 01:02:03.000
Therefore, we are all tied together.

01:02:05.000 --> 01:02:07.000
And whatever a member of the corporation

01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:09.000
does,

01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:11.000
reflects on the whole corporation.

01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:13.000
And the chairman of the board

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:15.000
has the right to speak to God.

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:19.000
Is that it?

01:02:19.000 --> 01:02:21.000
Yeah.

01:02:21.000 --> 01:02:23.000
How does that make it that God is...

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:27.000
Does that make a mistake?

01:02:27.000 --> 01:02:29.000
That's the part I...

01:02:29.000 --> 01:02:31.000
Exactly. That's very good.

01:02:31.000 --> 01:02:33.000
Make a mistake like this.

01:02:33.000 --> 01:02:35.000
Either because he is not good,

01:02:35.000 --> 01:02:37.000
or because you are not good.

01:02:37.000 --> 01:02:39.000
But, it's a matter of suburb.

01:02:39.000 --> 01:02:41.000
Affects of the whole suburb.

01:02:41.000 --> 01:02:43.000
I understand that.

01:02:43.000 --> 01:02:45.000
Because it's all...

01:02:45.000 --> 01:02:47.000
No. No. I'm sorry.

01:02:47.000 --> 01:02:49.000
It's not that God...

01:02:49.000 --> 01:02:51.000
God is telling you.

01:02:51.000 --> 01:02:53.000
I mean,

01:02:53.000 --> 01:02:55.000
suppose...

01:02:55.000 --> 01:02:57.000
Quick.

01:02:57.000 --> 01:02:59.000
All of a sudden, it makes a boo-boo.

01:03:03.000 --> 01:03:05.000
It means that here

01:03:05.000 --> 01:03:07.000
God is telling him something.

01:03:07.000 --> 01:03:09.000
And the suburb...

01:03:09.000 --> 01:03:11.000
Yeah. Yeah.

01:03:11.000 --> 01:03:13.000
Right.

01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:15.000
It's his mistake.

01:03:15.000 --> 01:03:17.000
Makes a difference.

01:03:17.000 --> 01:03:19.000
It makes absolutely no difference.

01:03:19.000 --> 01:03:21.000
There's not a horn here.

01:03:21.000 --> 01:03:23.000
No. Means you are now a part of His.

01:03:23.000 --> 01:03:25.000
It's the same thing.

01:03:25.000 --> 01:03:27.000
If there is not a horn, then I could understand that.

01:03:27.000 --> 01:03:29.000
But makes no difference.

01:03:29.000 --> 01:03:31.000
It means that something is wrong.

01:03:31.000 --> 01:03:33.000
It doesn't say, you have a horn.

01:03:33.000 --> 01:03:35.000
It's the same thing.

01:03:37.000 --> 01:03:39.000
That's the same thing.

01:03:39.000 --> 01:03:41.000
Same thing. Because here

01:03:41.000 --> 01:03:43.000
we have a small corporation of 10 people.

01:03:43.000 --> 01:03:45.000
And we have a Chazan.

01:03:45.000 --> 01:03:47.000
He is representing us in front of God.

01:03:47.000 --> 01:03:49.000
So we don't care whether the mistake

01:03:49.000 --> 01:03:51.000
originated in the psychology of the Chazan

01:03:51.000 --> 01:03:53.000
or originated in a divine intervention.

01:03:53.000 --> 01:03:55.000
Something is wrong.

01:03:55.000 --> 01:03:57.000
There is a difference.

01:03:57.000 --> 01:03:59.000
Something is wrong.

01:04:01.000 --> 01:04:03.000
I think if the Chazan makes a mistake,

01:04:03.000 --> 01:04:05.000
and if he is saying, what has to do with the Chazan,

01:04:05.000 --> 01:04:07.000
and maybe it's something to do with the tzibbur,

01:04:07.000 --> 01:04:09.000
I say, maybe it's the tzibbur's fault for picking the Chazan.

01:04:09.000 --> 01:04:11.000
It makes no difference.

01:04:11.000 --> 01:04:13.000
All those things make no difference.

01:04:13.000 --> 01:04:15.000
It makes no difference why it comes.

01:04:15.000 --> 01:04:17.000
Let's continue further.

01:04:27.000 --> 01:04:29.000
Now, he was a very pious man.

01:04:29.000 --> 01:04:31.000
We're going to see further down.

01:04:31.000 --> 01:04:33.000
Very, very pious man.

01:04:33.000 --> 01:04:35.000
Probably he knew how to pray.

01:04:35.000 --> 01:04:37.000
I'm sure probably. I'm probably certain.

01:04:37.000 --> 01:04:39.000
And the people used to say,

01:04:39.000 --> 01:04:41.000
pray for this Choleh.

01:04:41.000 --> 01:04:43.000
So,

01:04:43.000 --> 01:04:45.000
after the prayer,

01:04:45.000 --> 01:04:47.000
you will know immediately whether this Choleh

01:04:47.000 --> 01:04:49.000
is going to live,

01:04:49.000 --> 01:04:51.000
or Baminan,

01:04:51.000 --> 01:04:53.000
is not going to survive.

01:04:55.000 --> 01:04:57.000
It always was infallible.

01:04:57.000 --> 01:04:59.000
Never made a decision.

01:04:59.000 --> 01:05:01.000
Now,

01:05:05.000 --> 01:05:07.000
Now,

01:05:07.000 --> 01:05:09.000
if I, by tefillah,

01:05:09.000 --> 01:05:11.000
flows

01:05:11.000 --> 01:05:13.000
to God,

01:05:13.000 --> 01:05:15.000
I know that God

01:05:15.000 --> 01:05:17.000
accepted my prayer.

01:05:17.000 --> 01:05:19.000
But, continue.

01:05:21.000 --> 01:05:23.000
Now, all of a sudden, I cannot say something.

01:05:23.000 --> 01:05:25.000
I hear the

01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:28.000
somehow words do not come out of my mouth.

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:32.000
Words do not come out of my mouth.

01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:36.000
And the idea that this guy

01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:38.000
is no good.

01:05:38.000 --> 01:05:40.000
Yes.

01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:42.000
All right. Yes.

01:05:42.000 --> 01:05:44.000
Yes.

01:05:44.000 --> 01:05:46.000
Now, I connect

01:05:46.000 --> 01:05:48.000
this word, meturah,

01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:50.000
and with the preceding

01:05:50.000 --> 01:05:52.000
mishnah,

01:05:52.000 --> 01:05:54.000
it says,

01:05:55.000 --> 01:05:57.000
One second.

01:05:57.000 --> 01:05:59.000
One second.

01:05:59.000 --> 01:06:01.000
Yes?

01:06:01.000 --> 01:06:03.000
Halal?

01:06:03.000 --> 01:06:05.000
Yes.

01:06:05.000 --> 01:06:07.000
You see now how bad it is.

01:06:07.000 --> 01:06:09.000
All right.

01:06:11.000 --> 01:06:13.000
It means two things in Hebrew.

01:06:17.000 --> 01:06:19.000
Which means no good.

01:06:19.000 --> 01:06:21.000
Which means no good.

01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:23.000
It also means confusing.

01:06:23.000 --> 01:06:25.000
You are confused.

01:06:25.000 --> 01:06:27.000
So, here the word tiruv is played

01:06:27.000 --> 01:06:29.000
in two senses.

01:06:29.000 --> 01:06:31.000
Halal means meturah.

01:06:31.000 --> 01:06:33.000
It means there is confusion.

01:06:33.000 --> 01:06:35.000
But also, it means

01:06:35.000 --> 01:06:37.000
like taraf.

01:06:37.000 --> 01:06:39.000
Like tarifah is an animal

01:06:39.000 --> 01:06:41.000
that is not going to live.

01:06:41.000 --> 01:06:43.000
Same thing.

01:06:43.000 --> 01:06:45.000
That's right.

01:06:45.000 --> 01:06:47.000
It was a behemoth

01:06:47.000 --> 01:06:49.000
torn into pieces.

01:06:49.000 --> 01:06:51.000
So, meturah means that

01:06:51.000 --> 01:06:53.000
it is a behemoth that is going to die

01:06:53.000 --> 01:06:55.000
because an animal

01:06:55.000 --> 01:06:57.000
tore a piece out of it.

01:06:57.000 --> 01:06:59.000
All right.

01:06:59.000 --> 01:07:01.000
Continue.

01:07:01.000 --> 01:07:03.000
All right.

01:07:03.000 --> 01:07:05.000
Now, one second.

01:07:05.000 --> 01:07:07.000
In here, we are going to see later on

01:07:07.000 --> 01:07:09.000
