01:10:29.000 --> 01:10:31.000
No. I mean authority.

01:10:31.000 --> 01:10:33.000
Maybe the guy doesn't know anything.

01:10:33.000 --> 01:10:35.000
Maybe the guy is unqualified.

01:10:35.000 --> 01:10:37.000
He is from a non-registered,

01:10:37.000 --> 01:10:39.000
non-matriculated school. A private school.

01:10:39.000 --> 01:10:41.000
I don't know.

01:10:41.000 --> 01:10:43.000
Pittman used to be a school for typing.

01:10:43.000 --> 01:10:45.000
It is not an official school.

01:10:45.000 --> 01:10:47.000
So how do we know the guy is good?

01:10:47.000 --> 01:10:49.000
Hal derabi yanay.

01:10:49.000 --> 01:10:51.000
Because

01:10:51.000 --> 01:10:53.000
even if he would be Mr. Genius,

01:10:53.000 --> 01:10:55.000
he still would be worthless.

01:10:55.000 --> 01:10:57.000
You know why is it good?

01:11:01.000 --> 01:11:03.000
Because Rab Safra, who is a faculty member,

01:11:03.000 --> 01:11:05.000
